  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 11 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\n6 June Place, Torbay – A Home Filled with Memories\r\n\r\nA much-loved family home ready to welcome its next chapter.\r\n\r\nSet on a full 606sqm (more or less) site, this property offers three bedrooms, one bathroom and two living areas, providing comfortable space for families, first-home buyers or those seeking a relaxed lifestyle.\r\n\r\nCherished by the same owners for 33 wonderful years, this home has been the setting for countless precious memories. As the owners prepare to embrace a new chapter of life in a retirement village, they are ready to pass this special home on to its next family. With their retirement plans moving forward, this property must be sold, presenting an exciting opportunity for buyers.\r\n\r\nOne of the home’s highlights is its generous backyard, filled with established fruit trees, including figs, lemons, peaches and feijoas. Imagine picking fresh fruit straight from your own garden and enjoying the simple pleasures of outdoor living.\r\n\r\nWith its full-site land, practical layout and fruitful garden, this property offers space to enjoy today and potential to create many more happy memories for years to come.\r\n\r\nAfter 33 years of love and care, it’s time for a new family to make this home their own.\r\n\r\nThe owners are motivated to sell, and this is an opportunity not to be missed!",
